## GIT SAFETY

- Never auto commit/push.
- Never work in Detached HEAD.
- Never reset/clean/discard owner changes.
- Verify branch and working tree before edits.
- No `git reset`, `git clean`, or `git checkout --` to “fix” accidental files without explicit owner approval.

## RULE PRIORITY

Apply this guard **before** coding, testing, installing dependencies, or browser QA.
